                                                "sense_id": "cfa0e572-e567-314e-bd41-419308546e2b",
                                                "text": "The mate had procured other tasties too, olives and such, for later in the evening."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ebb73e0-cd69-43ec-a000-109d52a6e45c",
                                                "sense_id": "cfa0e572-e567-314e-bd41-419308546e2b",
                                                "text": "Sean then made up the most delicious pâté to have with biscuits and various other tasties."
